                        jsonPath("$.csrf").optional().saveAs("csrf")))))
            // One commit attempt per journey. HTTP 200 with accepted:false is a business
            // decline: the accepted check must fail the sample, and nothing further is sent.
            .exec(doIf(session -> session.contains("cart")).then(
                exec(http("commit").post("/v2/orders")
                    .header("Content-Type", "application/json")
                    .header("X-CSRF-Token", "#{csrf}")
